# AWS Setup: https://aws.amazon.com/getting-started/
# Stripe Setup: https://stripe.com/docs/development/quickstart
# OpenWeather API: https://openweathermap.org/api
# Sentry Setup: https://docs.sentry.io/platforms/python/
# Datadog Setup: https://docs.datadoghq.com/getting_started/
# Docker Compose: https://docs.docker.com/compose/
# Redis Docker: https://hub.docker.com/_/redis
# MySQL Docker: https://hub.docker.com/_/mysql
#
